\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid556457 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 2. The Toy Bow and Suction Cup String
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid556457 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 The Action:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457  
A loose, unwound string is attached to a toy bow. When the bow moves or the string is plucked, it flops around lazily.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 The Physics:}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457 
 The two ends of the string tied to the bow are fixed anchor points (nodes). Because the string is not wound tight, it lacks tension. Low tension dramatically slows down the speed of the wave traveling through the string. This makes the string oscillate i
n large, slow, highly visible waves with maximum displacement in the center (the antinode).
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid556457 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 3. The Grip of the Pen
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls3\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid556457 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 The Action:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457 
 Holding the pen loosely between your fingers rather than gripping it tightly. [}{\field\fldedit{\*\fldinst {\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457 HYPERLINK "https://www.spielwarenmesse.de/en/mag/toy-lab/pain-free-writing/"}{
