(E_p = \\frac\{1\}\{2\}kx^2\\), where k is the spring constant and x is the draw length.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 The Flaw:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457  If the string is not wound tight (slack), the initial phase of the draw (x) merely removes the slack without storing energy. The effective power stroke is reduced, leading to negligible exit velocity.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 The Operator's Fix:}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457  The SEAL would shorten the string or twist it to induce }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 pre-tension}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457 
. This ensures that F > 0 (force) from the very first millimetre of the draw, maximising the area under the Force-Draw curve (total work done).
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid556457 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 2. External Ballistics: The "Blunt Body" Problem

\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457 The suction cup arrow represents a unique aerodynamic challenge compared to a standard ogive-tipped projectile.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar
