\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457  To achieve a hit at range, the operator must apply significant }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 superelevation}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid556457\charrsid556457  (aiming high). They would calculate a steep parabolic trajectory to compensate for the rapid loss of kinetic energy (\\(\\frac\{1\}\{2\}mv^2\\)) due to air resistance.
