\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457  The holding force (F) is determined by \\(F = A \\times (P_\{atm\} - P_\{internal\})\\), where A is the area of the cup and \\(P_\{atm\}\\) is atmospheric pressure.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 Optimisation:}{\rtlch\fcs1 
