\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457 Your nervous system is designed to detect }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid556457\charrsid556457 change}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid556457\charrsid556457 
